        "body": "<p>Dear Tom,</p><p>I hope this message finds you well. My name is Sarah Vogel, and I am the VP of Product Innovation at European FinTech Collective. We are currently working on a project aimed at enhancing our understanding of response-latency patterns across various FinTech platforms.</p><p>We believe that a collaborative approach could greatly benefit both our organizations, particularly in the realm of simulation workflows. I would love to discuss how we might align our efforts and explore potential design partnerships.</p><p>To give you a better idea of what we are working on, I have attached a document titled <strong>fintech_simulation_benchmark_v2.pdf</strong>. This benchmark outlines our methodology, detection thresholds, and findings specific to our cohort.</p><p>Looking forward to your thoughts and insights.</p><p>Best regards,<br>Sarah Vogel<br>VP Product Innovation<br>European FinTech Collective</p>",
